{"property_id":"9468885990","name":"RISE Florence Villa Townhomes","is_named":true,"property_type":"apartment","address":"515 Corso Ln","unit":null,"city":"Davenport","zip":"33897","coordinates":{"lon":-81.660146,"lat":28.319353},"radius_miles":16.71,"url":"https://www.realtor.com/rentals/details/515-Corso-Ln_Davenport_FL_33897_M94688-85990","source_last_updated":"2026-11-11T00:25:28Z","offers":[{"beds":2,"baths":2.5,"rent":1895,"sqft":1301,"availability":"2026-11-11","level":"community unit/floor-plan feed; exact unit number not supplied"},{"beds":3,"baths":2.5,"rent":2099,"sqft":1504,"availability":"2026-12-01","level":"community unit/floor-plan feed; exact unit number not supplied"}],"details":["Barbecue Area","Club House","Exterior Type: Conventional","Fitness Center","Green Space","Located Next to BridgePrep Academy","PetsAllowed","Play Ground","Pool","Semi-private Cabanas","Smoke Free","Spacious Units","TV Lounge","Valet Trash","Dogs Allowed","Cats Allowed"],"tags":["community_clubhouse","recreation_facilities","community_gym","pets_allowed","community_no_fee","swimming_pool","two_or_more_stories","garage_1_or_more","gourmet_kitchen","floor_plan","clubhouse","park","shopping"],"description":"Elegant, beautiful, and luxurious 2- and 3-bedroom townhomes are ready to welcome you home in Davenport, FL. RISE Florence Villa townhomes offer upscale, luxury living in Davenport, FL. The location, near US Highway 27, provides unbeatable convenience and access. A central location puts you moments from the best Davenport has to offer: dining, shopping, groceries, and more. A short, easy commute puts you where you want to be including Walt Disney World and Universal Studios. Our suite of incredible resident amenities ensures that RISE Florence Villa feels like a community for growth, empowerment, and relaxation. Socialize in our resident clubhouse, take a dip in the resort-style pool, relax in a semi-private cabana, get your sweat on in the fitness center, level up your career in inspired individual workspaces, or gather with friends around the community grill stations. There's so much to explore and enjoy at RISE Florence Villa. RISE Florence Villa is pet friendly which means your furry friends can feel welcome as well. Whether your socializing your pup in the dog park, or giving them the spa treatment in the pet wash station, your animal companions are part of the family. Focus on the details in our 2- and 3-bedroom townhomes. Spacious floor plans invite you in while luxury finishes make you feel at home. Private garages, walk-in closets, and powder rooms give you the space you want with plenty of room to grow. Stainless steel appliances, tile backsplashes, and glass-top cooking ranges make your kitchen gourmet-ready - you can be the host with the most. Wood-plank inspired flooring on the first floor, kitchen, bathrooms, and laundry add to the elegance of your home while your patio offers the perfect place to relax and enjoy time with friends, family, or even some alone time. There's more to discover at RISE Florence Villa. We invite you to learn more.","age_restricted":false,"income_restricted":false,"flags":["Some options are future availability"],"min_rent":1895,"images":[{"url":"https://ar.rdcpix.com/1c4dac13bb69024d233dfeab7b28be46c-f3796642484r.jpg","title":null,"tags":["patio","swimming_pool","exterior"],"primary":true,"origins":[{"kind":"primary"},{"kind":"listing"},{"kind":"api_gallery"}],"source_urls":["https://ar.rdcpix.com/1c4dac13bb69024d233dfeab7b28be46c-f3796642484s.jpg","https://ar.rdcpix.com/1c4dac13bb69024d233dfeab7b28be46c-f3796642484r.jpg"],"resolution_source":"API size:MAX"},{"url":"https://ar.rdcpix.com/1c4dac13bb69024d233dfeab7b28be46c-f1627006697r.jpg","title":null,"tags":["kitchen"],"primary":false,"origins":[{"kind":"listing"},{"kind":"api_gallery"}],"source_urls":["https://ar.rdcpix.com/1c4dac13bb69024d233dfeab7b28be46c-f1627006697s.jpg","https://ar.rdcpix.com/1c4dac13bb69024d233dfeab7b28be46c-f1627006697